sequenceDiagram
    participant R as EMSRuntime
    participant E as ems_service.advance
    participant M as Backward Metrics
    participant S as ConsumptionSubject
    participant A as ConsumptionAlertObserver
    participant C as REST or WebSocket Client

    R->>E: advance(context)
    E->>M: record completed grid and renewable draw
    E->>M: read combined consumption by load
    E->>S: notify(ConsumptionEvent)
    S->>A: update(event)
    A->>A: record values above threshold
    R->>C: broadcast snapshot with alerts
